Package: blue-yeti-autoreset
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, systemd
Suggests: pulseaudio-utils, python3, python3-websocket
Description: automatic recovery for Blue Yeti microphones that stop capturing
 Some 2020-2023 Blue Yeti Classic microphones (USB 046d:0ab7, firmware 0.20)
 stay detected by USB, ALSA and PipeWire after a reboot, resume or replug but
 never deliver any audio. This package sends the same volatile firmware reset
 that the official control software uses, automatically at boot, after
 suspend/hibernate and whenever the microphone is plugged in.
 .
 It also ships an optional per-user helper, blue-yeti-obs-reconnect, that
 makes OBS Studio pick the microphone up again after a reset.
